# A connect's page on the desktop (sfpages connect.mbt, the web's pages/Connect.tsx): MBUI_WIN=1280x800 over the
# made-up chat. 连接 from the rail, a connect opened; its ⋯; 更改: all its messages in one session chosen, what that
# does said; back to the connects.
timeout 30000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap icon:im
wait 1500
tap 星火助手
wait 1500
tap icon:more
wait 1000
key escape
wait 600
tap =更改
wait 1200
tap 所有 thread 共用一个会话
wait 1500
tap 取消
wait 900
tap =连接
wait 1200
exit
